  "code": "WPD.07.A",
  "desc": "WATERPROOFING WORKS {BALCONY WALL (UPTO 200 MM HIGHT)} Providing and applying integral multi-layer waterproofing treatment on vertical and horizontal surfaces of depressed portions of W.C., bathrooms, kitchens, balconies, stilts, etc., including surface preparation, cleaning, sealing of all junctions, joints, corners and pipe penetrations, consisting of: (a) first course of cement slurry mixed with an approved integral waterproofing compound, (b) second course of cement plaster mixed with waterproofing compound, including rounding off the junction, (c) third course of polymer modified slurry, (d) fourth course of protective cement plaster, including curing, scaffolding, labour, tools and tackles, making good adjoining surfaces and ensuring watertightness, as directed by the Engineer-in-Charge."
